  l3Assisted:
    instructionText: Fit the crankshaft.
    instructionDetail: 'Fit the crankshaft into the main bearing saddles in the block.

      1. 
      Take the crankshaft from the tray.

      2.  Line its journals up with the
      bearing saddles.

      3.  Lower it straight down until it sits flat.'
